      "text": "SUMMARY\nSenior Frontend Engineer based in Berlin, Germany, with 7 years of total software development experience\nacross the E-commerce and Digital Media industries. Skilled in React, TypeScript, JavaScript, HTML/CSS,\nNext.js, Redux, Webpack, and Jest. Currently employed at Kinetix Digital after previously working at AeroFlux\nMedia, with experience leading technical frontend initiatives and mentoring junior team members."
