      "text": "EXPERIENCE\nSenior Frontend Engineer — Kinetix Digital Mar 2022 – Present\nIndustry: E-commerce\n• Developed scalable web application features using React, TypeScript, and Next.js.\n• Implemented automated unit tests with Jest and built responsive user interfaces using HTML/CSS.\nFrontend Developer — AeroFlux Media Mar 2019 – Feb 2022\nIndustry: Digital Media\n• Engineered interactive frontend components using React, JavaScript, and Redux.\n• Configured frontend asset bundling with Webpack and styled web pages with HTML/CSS."
